---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';

interface Props { locale: 'zh' | 'en'; }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
---

<AppLayout
  title={t('BaseModel 的开发与上线', 'How BaseModel is developed and shipped')}
  description={t(
    'BaseModel 使用 GitHub Actions 做双重代码验收，优先由 Cloudflare Access 保护的网站发布，Vercel 保留按额度切换的受保护回退。',
    'BaseModel uses two GitHub Actions acceptance gates, ships normally through a Cloudflare Access-protected site, and preserves Vercel as a quota-aware protected fallback.',
  )}
  locale={locale}
>
  <div class="shell development-page">
    <header class="development-hero page-header">
      <h1>{t('BaseModel 的开发与上线', 'How BaseModel is developed and shipped')}</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        {t(
          '在 GitHub 保存源码和版本，GitHub Actions 自动做浏览器测试和 Cloudflare 构建检查。合并后按额度选择：默认发布到受 Cloudflare Access 保护的新站；Vercel 旧站继续保留，必要时手动更新。',
          'GitHub stores the source and history. GitHub Actions automatically tests browsers and validates a Cloudflare build. After merging, we normally ship to the Cloudflare Access-protected site; the existing Vercel site remains available for deliberate fallback.',
        )}
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="development-system" aria-labelledby="development-system-title">
      <h2 id="development-system-title">{t('一条主线', 'The main path')}</h2>
      <ol class="development-flow" aria-label={t('BaseModel 开发与上线流程', 'BaseModel development and release flow')}>
        <li data-role="control"><span>01</span><div><strong>ChatGPT</strong><small>{t('说清目标、审阅结果', 'set the goal, review the result')}</small></div></li>
        <li data-role="source"><span>02</span><div><strong>GitHub</strong><small>{t('源码、分支、PR、main', 'source, branches, PRs, main')}</small></div></li>
        <li data-role="accept"><span>03</span><div><strong>GitHub Actions</strong><small>{t('代码 + 浏览器验收', 'repository + browser acceptance')}</small></div></li>
        <li data-role="provider"><span>04</span><div><strong>Cloudflare artifact</strong><small>{t('离线检查；不部署', 'offline check; no deploy')}</small></div></li>
        <li data-role="ship"><span>05</span><div><strong>Cloudflare / Vercel</strong><small>{t('按额度选择发布商', 'choose a release provider')}</small></div></li>
        <li data-role="observe"><span>06</span><div><strong>{t('授权核验', 'Authorized verification')}</strong><small>{t('只通过受保护访问检查 Production', 'inspect Production through protected access only')}</small></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="system-boundary">
        {t(
          '普通 PR 和 main 合并不再自动部署到 Vercel。两道 GitHub 检查都不使用发布额度；只有明确选择发布 Cloudflare 或 Vercel 时才消耗对应服务商的额度。',
          'Ordinary PRs and main merges do not auto-deploy to Vercel. Neither GitHub check consumes a provider deployment; only an explicitly selected Cloudflare or Vercel release does.',
        )}
      </p>
      <p class="system-boundary">{t('两条受保护的入口（版本可能不同）：', 'Two protected destinations (versions may differ):')} <a href="https://basemodel-access-standby.gemini202405.workers.dev/">Cloudflare Access</a> · <a href="https://basemodel-preview.vercel.app/">Vercel Authentication</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="development-handbook" aria-labelledby="development-handbook-title">
      <h2 id="development-handbook-title">{t('技术手册', 'Technical handbook')}</h2>
      <p>{t('开发页面解释工具之间的职责；需要逐步检查 Agent Harness 或 OpenEVO GPU 调度时，可进入有目录、搜索和明确来源的技术手册。', 'This page explains the roles; for step-by-step Agent Harness and OpenEVO GPU guidance, use the searchable technical handbook.')}</p>
      <p><a href="/handbook/">{t('打开技术手册 →', 'Open the technical handbook →')}</a></p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="tool-roles-title">
      <h2 id="tool-roles-title">{t('每个工具负责什么', 'What each tool does')}</h2>
      <div class="tool-roles">
        <article><h3>{t('ChatGPT 网页端', 'ChatGPT on the web')}</h3><p>{t('这是人的控制界面：提出目标、给反馈、看 Preview、决定是否继续。它不替代 GitHub 里的源码和历史。', 'This is the human control surface: set goals, give feedback, review Previews, and decide what happens next. It does not replace source or history in GitHub.')}</p></article>
        <article><h3>{t('GitHub 插件', 'GitHub plugin')}</h3><p>{t('让 Agent 直接读写仓库、PR、检查状态和评论。能走 API 的控制面优先走 API，不靠浏览器反复点按钮。', 'It lets the Agent read and write repositories, pull requests, checks, and comments directly. Provider control planes use APIs first instead of repeated browser clicking.')}</p></article>
        <article><h3>Remote Desktop Commander</h3><p>{t('需要真实文件系统、终端、Git、Node、Playwright 或本机 CLI 时，通过授权的电脑执行。它是开发工具；只有主 CI 不可用时，才作为手动恢复路径。', 'When the work needs the real filesystem, terminal, Git, Node, Playwright, or a local CLI, it runs on an authorized computer. It is a development tool and only becomes a manual recovery path when the primary CI is unavailable.')}</p></article>
        <article><h3>GitHub</h3><p>{t('源码的唯一主线。分支、PR、main、required check 和可审计历史都在这里。合并只认当前候选 SHA 的验收结果。', 'The source-of-truth repository. Branches, PRs, main, required checks, and auditable history live here. Merge acceptance belongs to the current candidate SHA.')}</p></article>
        <article><h3>Vercel</h3><p>{t('保留已有的 Vercel Authentication 登录保护与上一份可用的网站。普通 PR 和 main 合并不自动花 Hobby 部署额度；Cloudflare 不可用或额度受限时，再显式手动发布 Vercel。', 'Keeps Vercel Authentication and the last known-good website. Ordinary PRs and main merges do not automatically spend Hobby deployments; a Vercel release is selected manually when Cloudflare is unavailable or quota-constrained.')}</p></article>
        <article><h3>Cloudflare</h3><p>{t('默认发布到现有的受 Cloudflare Access 保护的 Worker。候选先在 GitHub Actions 做不带密钥的静态构建与 dry-run；发布必须从 main 手动触发，发布前后检查匿名访问会被挡住。', 'The normal release destination is the existing Cloudflare Access-protected Worker. GitHub Actions checks the candidate offline without secrets; publishing is a deliberate main-only action with anonymous-access checks before and after deployment.')}</p></article>
        <article><h3>CircleCI</h3><p>{t('2026-09-08，CircleCI credits 已耗尽，因此它退出普通 PR/main 流程。已经验证过的配置仍保留，只在需要独立恢复或交叉验证时显式手动触发。', 'On 2026-09-08, the CircleCI credit balance was exhausted, so it left the ordinary PR/main path. The qualified configuration remains available only for explicit manual recovery or cross-checking.')}</p></article>
        <article><h3>GitHub Actions</h3><p>{t('公开托管 runner 必须同时通过 public-ci-gate（代码与真实浏览器）和 cloudflare-artifact-gate（Worker 安全构建）。缺少任何一个都不能合并；Mac/OrbStack 只是手动恢复，不必一直开机。', 'Hosted runners require both public-ci-gate (repository and real browsers) and cloudflare-artifact-gate (secure Worker build). Neither can be skipped to merge; Mac/OrbStack remains manual recovery only.')}</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ci-section" aria-labelledby="ci-title">
      <h2 id="ci-title">{t('CI 方案', 'CI design')}</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        {t(
          '我们优化的不是“哪家免费次数最多”，而是一次可信合并要花多少钱、等多久。',
          'The optimization target is not “which provider has the biggest free quota,” but the cost and waiting time of one trustworthy merge.',
        )}
      </p>
      <ol class="ci-steps">
        <li><strong>{t('普通分支只开发。', 'Ordinary branches are for development.')}</strong><span>{t('research、fix、docs 等分支可以继续迭代，不因为每个 push 都消耗 Vercel Preview。', 'research, fix, docs, and other working branches can keep moving without paying for a Vercel Preview on every push.')}</span></li>
        <li><strong>{t('两道检查，不发布网站。', 'Two checks, zero deployments.')}</strong><span>{t('public-ci-gate 检查代码和浏览器；cloudflare-artifact-gate 验证 Worker 构建与安全设置。都绑定同一个最新 SHA。', 'public-ci-gate checks code and browsers; cloudflare-artifact-gate checks the Worker build and security settings. Both bind to the same current SHA.')}</span></li>
        <li><strong>{t('浏览器范围按风险升级。', 'Browser scope escalates with risk.')}</strong><span>{t('非 UI 改动可不跑浏览器；局部页面跑映射测试；全局或未知改动跑完整 Chromium 和 WebKit。全部已分配测试必须通过。', 'Non-UI changes can skip browsers, bounded changes get mapped tests, and global/unknown changes run the complete Chromium and WebKit coverage. Every allocated test must pass.')}</span></li>
        <li><strong>{t('合并必须同 SHA 双绿。', 'Merge only when both gates pass on the same SHA.')}</strong><span>{t('两道检查必须在最新、与 main 对齐的 PR 提交上通过；不能用旧的 green 或混合不同重试轮次的截图蒙混过关。', 'Both gates must pass on the latest PR head, current with main; old green checks and screenshots from mismatched retry attempts do not count.')}</span></li>
        <li><strong>{t('按额度发布，实际看页面。', 'Choose a provider, then verify the live site.')}</strong><span>{t('默认手动发布 Cloudflare，验证部署 SHA、登录和真实页面交互；只有 Cloudflare 受限时才手动更新 Vercel。旧站始终可回退。', 'Publish to Cloudflare explicitly by default and verify the deployed SHA, login and real browser interactions. Update Vercel manually only when Cloudflare is constrained, keeping the existing fallback.')}</span></li>
      </ol>

      <details class="technical-detail">
        <summary>{t('Agent 执行时用到的 exact-head 细节', 'Exact-head details used by the Agent')}</summary>
        <p>{t('合并前，严格检查当前 PR HEAD 同时取得', 'Before merge, verify the current PR HEAD has both')} <code>public-ci-gate</code> {t('和', 'and')} <code>cloudflare-artifact-gate</code> {t('的 GitHub Actions 成功状态。', 'successful GitHub Actions checks.')}</p>
        <p>{t('Cloudflare 发布从受保护的 main 工作流', 'Cloudflare is released only from the protected main workflow')} <code>cloudflare-standby.yml</code> {t('显式选择 deploy；Vercel 的', 'with explicit deploy. Vercel’s')} <code>ci/vercel-gate-final</code> {t('仅在需要备用商验收时使用，不再是普通合并门槛。', 'is optional fallback validation, no longer an ordinary merge requirement.')}</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="change-flow-title">
      <h2 id="change-flow-title">{t('一次改动怎样上线', 'How one change gets shipped')}</h2>
      <ol class="change-flow">
        <li><span>1</span><div><strong>{t('在 ChatGPT 里说清楚要改什么', 'Describe the change in ChatGPT')}</strong><p>{t('人负责目标、反馈和最终判断。', 'The human owns the goal, feedback, and final judgment.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>2</span><div><strong>{t('Agent 在 GitHub / 本机完成实现', 'The Agent implements through GitHub / the local machine')}</strong><p>{t('仓库读写优先 GitHub 插件；文件、终端和本机工具需要时用 Remote Desktop Commander。', 'Repository operations prefer the GitHub plugin; filesystem, terminal, and local tools use Remote Desktop Commander when needed.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>3</span><div><strong>{t('先做便宜的静态检查', 'Start with inexpensive static checks')}</strong><p>{t('能快速发现的类型、单元与安全问题先处理；日常正式 CI 在 GitHub 云端运行，不依赖个人 Mac。', 'Catch type, unit and safety problems early; regular required CI runs on GitHub-hosted runners, not the owner’s Mac.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>4</span><div><strong>{t('跑完两道 GitHub 检查', 'Complete both GitHub checks')}</strong><p>{t('同一提交通过代码/浏览器验收和 Cloudflare Worker 离线验收，不触发任何服务商部署。', 'The same commit must pass repository/browser and offline Cloudflare Worker acceptance, without triggering either provider deployment.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>5</span><div><strong>{t('通过后合并 main', 'Merge to main after acceptance')}</strong><p>{t('如果 main 或候选变了，就重新验当前 SHA。', 'If main or the candidate changes, acceptance is repeated on the new current SHA.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>6</span><div><strong>{t('选择服务商，登录验收', 'Choose the provider and verify with login')}</strong><p>{t('Cloudflare 默认、Vercel 回退；按需发布 exact main，确认 SHA、未登录用户被拒绝、桌面与手机页面真实可用。', 'Cloudflare by default, Vercel for fallback. Publish the exact main only when needed and verify its SHA, anonymous denial and real desktop/mobile functionality.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="docs-boundary" aria-labelledby="docs-boundary-title">
      <h2 id="docs-boundary-title">{t('人看网页，Agent 看文档', 'Humans use this page; Agents use the docs')}</h2>
      <p>{t('这张页面只负责让人快速理解当前方案。Agent 开始工作时应该先读仓库里的 ', 'This page is the human-readable map. An Agent starting work should read ')}<code>AGENTS.md</code>、<code>docs/agents/current/ci-provider-decision.md</code>、<code>hosting-architecture.md</code> {t('和可执行配置。', 'and the executable configuration.')}</p>
      <p>{t('供应商额度、required checks、runner 状态都会变化，所以这里不把某个月的价格或次数写成永久规则。页面和文档如果与 live provider state 冲突，以 live state 和仓库可执行配置为准。', 'Provider quotas, required checks, and runner state can change. This page therefore does not freeze a monthly price or quota as permanent policy. If the page or docs disagree with live provider state, live state and executable repository configuration win.')}</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</AppLayout>

<style>
  .development-hero .lede { margin: 1.35rem 0 0; color: var(--text); }
  section { margin-block: var(--space-7); }
  .development-flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.7rem); margin: 1.5rem 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .development-flow li { position: relative; min-width: 0; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-panel); background: var(--surface); }
  .development-flow li:not(:last-child)::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: calc(100% + 1px); width: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.7rem); height: 1px; background: var(--line-strong, var(--line)); }
  .development-flow li:not(:last-child)::before { content: ''; position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: calc(50% - 4px); left: calc(100% + clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.7rem) - 7px); width: 7px; height: 7px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong, var(--line)); border-right: 1px solid var(--line-strong, var(--line)); transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .development-flow li[data-role='control'] { border-top-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, var(--line)); }
  .development-flow li[data-role='source'] { border-top-color: color-mix(in srgb, #6d5bd0 58%, var(--line)); }
  .development-flow li[data-role='accept'] { border-top-color: color-mix(in srgb, #6d5bd0 58%, var(--line)); }
  .development-flow li[data-role='provider'], .development-flow li[data-role='ship'] { border-top-color: color-mix(in srgb, #2f8f5b 58%, var(--line)); }
  .development-flow li[data-role='observe'] { border-top-color: color-mix(in srgb, #2a72b8 58%, var(--line)); }
  .development-flow span { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--accent); font: var(--type-weight-label) var(--type-meta)/1 var(--font-interface); }
  .development-flow strong, .development-flow small { display: block; }
  .development-flow strong { font-size: var(--type-body); }
  .development-flow small { margin-top: .35rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; }
  .system-boundary, .section-lede { color: var(--muted); }
  .tool-roles { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tool-roles article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(170px, .7fr) minmax(0, 2fr); gap: 2rem; padding: 1.35rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tool-roles h3, .tool-roles p { margin: 0; }
  .tool-roles p { color: var(--muted); }
  .ci-steps { margin: 2rem 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); list-style: none; }
  .ci-steps li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(190px, .85fr) minmax(0, 1.8fr); gap: 2rem; padding: 1.2rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .ci-steps strong, .ci-steps span { display: block; }
  .ci-steps span { color: var(--muted); line-height: var(--type-leading-body); }
  .technical-detail { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .technical-detail summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: var(--type-weight-label); }
  .technical-detail p { color: var(--muted); }
  .change-flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0 2rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); list-style: none; }
  .change-flow li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(0, 1fr); gap: .8rem; padding: 1.3rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .change-flow li:nth-child(odd) { padding-right: 1rem; }
  .change-flow > li > span { color: var(--accent); }
  .change-flow strong { display: block; }
  .change-flow p { margin: .35rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .docs-boundary p { color: var(--muted); }
  code { font-size: var(--type-meta); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  @media (min-width: 861px) and (max-width: 1080px) {
    .development-flow { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .development-flow li:nth-child(3)::before, .development-flow li:nth-child(3)::after { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .development-flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .development-flow li { padding: 1rem; }
    .development-flow li:not(:last-child)::after { top: 100%; left: 50%; width: 1px; height: 1.5rem; }
    .development-flow li:not(:last-child)::before { top: calc(100% + 1.5rem - 8px); left: calc(50% - 3px); transform: rotate(135deg); }
    .tool-roles article, .ci-steps li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .5rem; }
    .change-flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .change-flow li:nth-child(odd) { padding-right: 0; }
  }
</style>
